---
import Settings from '../../layouts/Settings.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import {FITNESS_PROVIDERS as services} from '../../lib/fitness-providers.mjs';
---
<Settings title="Activities & maps settings" section="connections"><section class="settings-section"><h2>Activities & maps</h2><p>Bring a route into Explore without giving an app access to your whole activity account.</p><a class="btn" href="/places"><Icon name="mountain" size={16}/>Open map & GPX viewer</a></section><section class="settings-section"><h2>Your activity connections</h2><p>Strava is first on the roadmap, followed by the services below. GPX viewing works now; direct account syncing is not connected yet.</p><div class="service-list">{services.map(service=><article><div class="service-top"><h3>{service.name}</h3><span>{service.status}</span></div><p>{service.summary}</p><details><summary>Connection availability</summary><p>{service.availability}</p><a href={service.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Provider information <Icon name="arrow" size={14}/></a></details></article>)}</div></section><section class="settings-section"><h2>Keep your routes private</h2><p>GPX previews stay in your current browser view; this map does not upload or publish them. Exact track points may reveal a home address or a regular routine. Clear the track when finished, especially on a shared device.</p><p>Future account connections will be separate from public sharing. Connecting a service will not automatically publish your activities.</p></section><p>Looking for where apps save documents and photographs? <a href="/studio/storage">Files & storage →</a></p></Settings>
<style>.service-list article{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0}.service-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.service-top h3{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.service-list summary{font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;min-height:30px;display:flex;align-items:center}.service-list details p{font-size:12px}.service-list details[open]{padding-bottom:8px}.service-top h3{margin:0}.service-top span{font-size:10px;opacity:.7;text-align:right;max-width:150px;flex-shrink:0}.service-list a{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}.service-list p{margin:8px 0 10px}@media(max-width:550px){.service-top{align-items:flex-start}.service-top h3{font-size:17px}.service-top span{max-width:100px}.service-list summary,.service-list a{min-height:44px}}@media(forced-colors:active){.service-top span{opacity:1}}</style>
